                <rule id="964f-e6a4-10cf-68a3" name="?? Bombard Sub-type ?? (Ambiguity)" hidden="false">
                  <description>In French and German versions of both the LA books the Sicaran Venator has the Bombard Sub-type.
It is not known if this is a mistake or not, as previously like with the Mech book, the non-English versions had the correct profile for other misprints.</description>
