<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">A model with a Dark Abeyant has a Movement of 10 and the Cavalry unit type in place of Infantry, keeping its other sub-types. It also gains a warpfire lance.</characteristic>
