<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Friendly units with a Legiones Hereticus (X) special rule that are wholly within 8&quot; of a model with a hellfire veil have a 5+ invulnerable save. This does not stack with, or improve, any other invulnerable save.</characteristic>
