<selectionEntry id="2b7b-f3fd-53bc-f5bc" name="Legiones Hereticus (Night Lords)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
<profiles>
<profile id="8d3d-4063-5237-d096" name="Night Lords Advanced Reaction (Legiones Hereticus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">This Advanced Reaction is available only to units composed entirely of models with the Legiones Hereticus (Night Lords) special rule. It may be made once per battle and uses a point of the Reaction Allotment as normal.

Nightfall – (Shooting phase, once per battle). Trigger: an enemy unit declares a Shooting Attack targeting a unit with this rule. Against that attack, every model in the reacting unit has Shrouded (4+), or improves an existing Shrouded by 1, to a best of 3+.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
<infoLinks>
<infoLink id="f17b-e674-731f-1116" name="Legiones Hereticus (Night Lords)" hidden="false" targetId="caf2-c1d5-1bf7-3be6" type="rule"/>
</infoLinks>
