<selectionEntry id="ade7-d1c6-da45-a933" name="Legiones Hereticus (Sons of Horus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
<profiles>
<profile id="0e9a-4021-1193-37c6" name="Sons of Horus Advanced Reaction (Legiones Hereticus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">This Advanced Reaction is available only to units composed entirely of models with the Legiones Hereticus (Sons of Horus) special rule. It may be made once per battle and uses a point of the Reaction Allotment as normal.

Warmaster&apos;s Fury – (Assault phase, once per battle). Trigger: an enemy unit declares a Charge against a unit with this rule. Before the charge is resolved, the reacting unit makes a Shooting Attack against the charging unit at its normal Ballistic Skill.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
<infoLinks>
<infoLink id="eab0-e983-6b26-71a6" name="Legiones Hereticus (Sons of Horus)" hidden="false" targetId="157a-806d-be7f-4a4d" type="rule"/>
</infoLinks>
