</categoryLinks>
<costs>
<cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0.0"/>
</costs>
</selectionEntry>
<selectionEntry id="97e6-c0c5-25b7-6fc4" name="Legiones Hereticus (Thousand Sons)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
<profiles>
<profile id="05ca-27ec-3075-00a0" name="Thousand Sons Advanced Reaction (Legiones Hereticus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">This Advanced Reaction is available only to units composed entirely of models with the Legiones Hereticus (Thousand Sons) special rule. It may be made once per battle and uses a point of the Reaction Allotment as normal.

Warp Ward – (Shooting phase, once per battle). Trigger: an enemy unit declares a Shooting Attack targeting a unit with this rule. The reacting unit makes a Psychic check; if it passes, every model in it has a 4+ Invulnerable Save against that attack, or improves an existing one by 1, to a best of 3+. If it fails, it suffers Perils of the Warp.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
<infoLinks>
<infoLink id="ef7a-25ed-45c4-6a67" name="Legiones Hereticus (Thousand Sons)" hidden="false" targetId="4922-cbab-aff6-3056" type="rule"/>
</infoLinks>
