<selectionEntry id="6ebc-6f1b-a7f1-b642" name="Legiones Hereticus (Word Bearers)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
<profiles>
<profile id="aedb-fed5-a4cc-5530" name="Word Bearers Advanced Reaction (Legiones Hereticus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">This Advanced Reaction is available only to units composed entirely of models with the Legiones Hereticus (Word Bearers) special rule. It may be made once per battle and uses a point of the Reaction Allotment as normal.

Daemonic Possession – (Shooting phase, once per battle). Trigger: an enemy unit declares a Shooting Attack targeting a unit with this rule. Until that attack is resolved, every model in the reacting unit adds +1 to its Toughness and has Feel No Pain (5+); this is a Damage Mitigation roll.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
<infoLinks>
<infoLink id="7449-71dc-e89f-3a55" name="Legiones Hereticus (Word Bearers)" hidden="false" targetId="2bd3-26ac-6b3a-427b" type="rule"/>
</infoLinks>
<categoryLinks>
<categoryLink id="c077-d6bd-4a97-0134" name="Legiones Hereticus" hidden="false" targetId="d684-5b63-caa7-adc4" primary="false"/>
</categoryLinks>
<costs>
<cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0.0"/>
</costs>
</selectionEntry>
<selectionEntry id="d840-d1a5-3166-09c9" name="Legiones Hereticus (World Eaters)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
<profiles>
<profile id="9280-5bea-6b5a-f057" name="World Eaters Advanced Reaction (Legiones Hereticus)" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="90b9-7fab-87db-aed3" typeName="Reactions">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Description" typeId="c627-4637-8de5-65fb">This Advanced Reaction is available only to units composed entirely of models with the Legiones Hereticus (World Eaters) special rule. It may be made once per battle and uses a point of the Reaction Allotment as normal.

Blood Frenzy – (Assault phase, once per battle). Trigger: an enemy unit declares a Charge against a unit with this rule. The reacting unit counts as having made a successful Charge itself this phase, gaining Skulls for the Skull Throne and any bonuses for charging, and the charging unit does not.</characteristic>
