<profiles>
<profile id="f640-2c4b-338b-bc65" name="Warlord: Sire of the World Eaters" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">All models with Legiones Hereticus (World Eaters) in the same army, including the Warlord, gain Feel No Pain (6+) and Adamantium Will (3+). In addition, the army increases its Reaction Allotment to 3 in the opposing player&apos;s Movement phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty (this does not allow more than three Reactions in that phase, and may not be further modified), but may only make Advance Reactions.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
</entryLink>
