<profiles>
<profile id="7f4b-d3cf-451b-b3ae" name="Warlord: Sire of the Death Guard" publicationId="0b44-e890-1d51-5b89" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
<characteristics>
<characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">All friendly units composed entirely of models with Legiones Hereticus (Death Guard) in the same army, including the Warlord himself, ignore all Leadership penalties caused by Fear and Shell Shock (X), and when locked in combat suffer no Leadership penalty for casualties suffered during an assault. In addition, the army may take an additional Reaction in the opposing player&apos;s Assault phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
</characteristics>
</profile>
</profiles>
</entryLink>
