    <catalogueLink type="catalogue" name="Daemons - Daemons of the Ruinstorm" id="8b20-7569-6f4a-44f9" targetId="ac63-5340-2e9e-1eb6"/>
  </catalogueLinks>
  <comment>Do not import me into a non-LA list or you&apos;ll end up with rites of war.</comment>
</catalogue>
